      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the Mayor has caused to be prepared and has approved the details of a plan for such revision, and has agreed through collective bargaining with a number of City-wide majority representatives to include certain terms in currently negotiated agreements consistent with such plan, to take effect on a date following the implementation of such plan,",
